    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1528">

                <pb facs="1209" n="1199" sameAs="frus:frus1949v08/pg1199"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">123 Olive, William M.: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Shanghai</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Cabot</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-07-07T11:00:00+08:00">July 7, 1949—11 a.
                            m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received July 7—2:42 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2641. Vice Consul William Olive arrested yesterday afternoon while en route
                    filling station in jeep, apparently for alleged obstruction <pb facs="1210"
                        n="1200" xml:id="pg1200"/> Communists in parade. Still held incommunicado
                    this morning. Authorities refuse to divulge charge, will not let us see him or
                    take him food. We have report from Sikh eyewitness that he was severely beaten
                    last night after accidently overturning ink bottle. Chase and Supple<anchor
                        n="93" xml:id="d1528-f1"/> were rebuffed and insulted at police station this
                    morning, when they went there in effort to ascertain facts and assist him.
                    Separate report their experience follows.</p>
                <p>Sent Department 2641; repeated Nanking 1463, Peiping 191.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cabot</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1528-f1" n="93" xml:id="d1528-f1-content">
                <p>William J. Supple, Security Officer at Shanghai.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
